   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent021Text16",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent021Text16",
   "en": "I guess so.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 16,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text00",
   "en": "Hey, Sora!\nDid you remember anything\nelse about that girl?{END}",
   "max_units": 65,
   "units": 65,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text01",
   "en": "Yeah, bits and pieces.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 27,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text02",
   "en": "Tell us about her!\nTalking about it might help you\nremember.{END}",
   "max_units": 67,
   "units": 67,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text03",
   "en": "Okay.  Um…{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 15,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text13",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text13",
   "en": "Still, up until now you didn’t\nremember any of that!{END}",
   "max_units": 58,
   "units": 58,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text14",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text14",
   "en": "At this rate, you’ll think of\nher name in no time!{END}",
   "max_units": 56,
   "units": 56,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text15",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text15",
   "en": "Anyone notice something odd?\nSora’s remembering things,\ninstead of forgetting them.{END}",
   "max_units": 90,
   "units": 90,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text16",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text16",
   "en": "Hmm… Maybe forgetting things\nis the only way to reach the\nmemories buried deeper down.{END}",
   "max_units": 93,
   "units": 93,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text17",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text17",
   "en": "You mean you have to forget\nto remember?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 46,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text18",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text18",
   "en": "So it’s like those black-robed\nguys said.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 47,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text19",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text19",
   "en": "“Our most precious memories\nlie deep in our hearts, out of\nreach.”{END}",
   "max_units": 73,
   "units": 73,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text20",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text20",
   "en": "And all that stuff about\nfinding being losing and losing\nbeing finding…{END}",
   "max_units": 78,
   "units": 78,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text21",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text21",
   "en": "I didn’t get it at first, but\nmaybe this is what they were\ntalking about.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 80,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text22",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text22",
   "en": "Aww, that’s no fair!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 25,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text23",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text23",
   "en": "Why aren’t the rest of us\nremembering anything yet?{END}",
   "max_units": 57,
   "units": 57,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent022Text24",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent022Text24",
   "en": "Come on, Goofy!\nWe're not forgetting fast\nenough!  Let's move!{END}",
   "max_units": 69,
   "units": 69,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text00",
   "en": "It looks like Sora’s memories\nhave taken root, just as we\nplanned.{END}",
   "max_units": 73,
   "units": 73,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text01",
   "en": "Let’s see how far our boy will\ngo, then.  Think it’s time for\nanother round?{END}",
   "max_units": 83,
   "units": 83,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text02",
   "en": "Only if it’s my turn to play.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 34,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text03",
   "en": "You had your fun on the first\nfloor.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 42,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text04",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text04",
   "en": "Remember, Larxene.\nOur job is to deliver him in one\npiece.{END}",
   "max_units": 65,
   "units": 65,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text05",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text05",
   "en": "Fine.  But who says I can’t\nhave my way with him first?{END}",
   "max_units": 61,
   "units": 61,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text06",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text06",
   "en": "Don’t break him.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 21,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text07",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text07",
   "en": "Do I detect a soft spot?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 29,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text08",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text08",
   "en": "He’s partly one of us.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 27,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text09",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text09",
   "en": "I’m not going to break the toy,\nAxel―just play with it.  I’m not\ndumb.{END}",
   "max_units": 77,
   "units": 77,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text10",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text10",
   "en": "Then you won’t mind the\nwarning.  Remember, Sora is\nthe key.{END}",
   "max_units": 67,
   "units": 67,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text11",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text11",
   "en": "We need him if we’re going to\ntake the Organization.{END}",
   "max_units": 58,
   "units": 58,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text12",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text12",
   "en": "So you’re in on it, too?\nWell, keep it under your hood\nuntil the time is right.{END}",
   "max_units": 86,
   "units": 86,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent023Text13",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent023Text13",
   "en": "You would have been wise to\ndo the same, Larxene.{END}",
   "max_units": 55,
   "units": 55,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent024Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent024Text00",
   "en": "So, Sora…\nHave you remembered your\nfriend’s name yet?{END}",
   "max_units": 60,
   "units": 60,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent024Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent024Text01",
   "en": "Nope.  For whatever reason,\nher name’s the only thing that\nisn’t coming back.{END}",
   "max_units": 84,
   "units": 84,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent024Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent024Text02",
   "en": "That must be driving you\ncrazy.  You have the memories,\nbut no name to go with them.{END}",
   "max_units": 91,
   "units": 91,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent024Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent024Text03",
   "en": "Heh…yeah.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 14,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent025Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent025Text00",
   "en": "You’re with Axel, aren’t you!{END}",
